The four tiles show revenue, active users, churn and response time. Each tile shows its change from Q2 and an up or down trend. Revenue and active users went up. Churn and response time went down, which is good for those two metrics.

The chart puts each month of Q3 next to the same month of Q2. Q3 is higher in all three months, and the gap reaches $37K by the third month.
